---
import Photo from './Photo.astro';
---
<section class="lineage section on-dark" aria-labelledby="lineage-title">
  <div class="container grid">
    <div class="text">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>A thousand-year lineage</p>
      <h2 id="lineage-title" class="h2" data-reveal>From Avicenna, to&nbsp;now.</h2>
      <p class="lede" data-reveal>
        A thousand years ago, Ibn Sina, known to the West as Avicenna, wrote the Canon of Medicine,
        the text that trained Europe's physicians for six centuries. Two of his ideas still hold.
      </p>

      <dl class="terms">
        <div class="term" data-reveal>
          <dt><span class="word">Mizaj</span><span class="gloss">Constitution</span></dt>
          <dd>Every person is made differently, so no single regimen fits everyone.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="term" data-reveal>
          <dt><span class="word">Mizan</span><span class="gloss">Balance</span></dt>
          <dd>Health is the ongoing work of keeping that constitution in balance.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>

      <p class="close" data-reveal>
        We draw on the tradition that gave us the hammam and food as medicine, and add the one thing
        it never had: measurement.
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="frame" data-reveal>
      <div class="ratio">
        <Photo name="hammam" alt="The Mizan hammam: heated stone beneath a vaulted ceiling" sizes="(min-width: 960px) 40vw, 100vw" />
      </div>
      <figcaption>The Hammam</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr;
    gap: clamp(48px, 7vw, 120px);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .h2 { margin-top: 22px; }
  .lede { margin-top: 28px; }

  .terms {
    margin: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px) 0 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
  }
  .term {
    padding: 28px 28px 30px 0;
  }
  .term + .term {
    padding-left: 28px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
  }
  dt {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .word {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(30px, 3vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 360;
  }
  .gloss {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .24em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--brass-l);
  }
  dd {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    color: var(--on-dark-muted);
    max-width: 22em;
  }
  .close {
    margin-top: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 340;
    font-size: clamp(19px, 1.8vw, 24px);
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: rgb(244 239 229 / .88);
    max-width: 28em;
  }

  .frame { margin: 0; }
  .ratio {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .24em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--on-dark-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .frame { order: -1; max-width: 560px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .terms { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .term + .term { padding-left: 0; border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-dark); }
  }
</style>
